The '''Dojo Vault''' is a [[:Category:Locations|location]].

==Location==
The Dojo Vault is located at the [[Dragon Dojo]] in [[Hydra Island]].

==Lanterns==
===Red Lantern===
* For the {{Color|red|red}} lantern to light up, the player must have 500 Mastery on [[Dragon Talon]] and must have completed the Diplomacy quest from the [[Dojo Trainer]] to get upgraded [[Dragon Talon]].

===Green Lantern=== 
* For the {{Color|green|green}} lantern to light up, the player will need 500 mastery on [[Dragonheart]].

===Yellow Lantern===
* For the <span class="Outline-B">{{Color|yellow|yellow}}</span> lantern to light up, the player will need 500 mastery on [[Dragonstorm]].

==Opening==

# To open the Dojo Vault's door, the player must have all the requirements to light the lanterns, then they'll need to hunt the [[Leviathan]] and use the [[Beast Hunter]] boat to harpoon the [[Leviathan Heart]]. The player must then bring the [[Leviathan Heart]] to the waterfall on [[Hydra Island]], this will freeze the island, causing the islands' name to change to [[Freezing Hydra Island]]. Then the player must go up to the [[Dragon Dojo]] and interact with the [[Dragon Wizard]] to receive the dialogue "Freezing the island was a great idea! We have protection from cold in our dojo, but those venom invaders are vulnerable. We will soon take back our lands thanks to you! During times of such chilling weather, the most loyal Draco soldiers are to be tested". The player will now have the ability to light the lanterns. Once all lanterns are lit, the door will be opened. Leaving the room will not close the vault.

